{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"一、二十有四年，春王三月，刻桓宮桷。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？刻桓宮桷，非禮也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"二、葬，曹莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"三、夏，公如齊逆女。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"何以書？親迎禮也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"四、秋，公至自齊。八月丁丑，夫人姜氏入。戊寅，大夫、宗婦覿用幣。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"其言入何？難也。其言日何？難也。其難奈何？夫人不僂不可使入；與公有所約，然後入。宗婦者何？大夫之妻也。覿者何？見也。用者何？用者不宜用也。見用幣，非禮也。然則曷用？棗栗云乎！暇脩云乎！","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"五、大水。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"六、冬，戎侵曹，曹羈出奔陳。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"曹羈者何？曹大夫也。曹無大夫，此何以書？賢也。何賢乎曹羈？戎將侵曹，曹羈諫曰：「戎眾以無義，君請勿自敵也。」曹伯曰：「不可。」三諫，不從，遂去之，故君子以為得君臣之義也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"七、赤歸于曹郭公。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_53_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_53","textTraditional":"赤者何？曹無赤者，蓋郭公也。郭公者何？失地之君也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}